<para>Free a memory block which has been allocated with a function of <ref refid="group__lavu__mem__funcs_1gaafef95f25208665371057f89fb5a11b8" kindref="member">av_malloc()</ref> or <ref refid="group__lavu__mem__funcs_1ga45fc6fd08120d07ddf4ed39f597f31b4" kindref="member">av_realloc()</ref> family, and set the pointer pointing to it to <computeroutput>NULL</computeroutput>. </para>
