<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>dereference<sp/>of<sp/>buf<sp/>will<sp/>result<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>use-after-free,<sp/>which<sp/>may<sp/>be<sp/>a</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
